    "note": "Official means first-party for the publisher's own institution/event, not a claim of government endorsement or external accreditation. Follow-up verification on 2026-11-10 confirmed Teatro Verdi Trieste and Teatro Lirico di Cagliari as official and relevant vocal sources using direct first-party chorus recruitment notices. Musical.it was classified out of scope for this classical-vocal registry because its inspected audition board focuses on musical-theatre performers and related training. Provinispettacolo remains needs_review: its domain carries useful opera-singer discovery notices, but the registered Robin Hood permalink is cross-genre and is not a primary organizer notice. Other follow-up evidence confirmed Maggio Musicale Fiorentino, Teatro Lirico Sperimentale di Spoleto, Fondazione Renata Tebaldi, and AsLiCo as official relevant vocal sources; Winterwerft was classified out of scope."
